      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "At this point it doesn't seem like security is a big concern for the VRChat team. They didn't address security in any significant way during the IL2CPP update where they would've had the perfect opportunity to do so, and I've personally seen them unban users who were actively selling modified clients despite knowing their malicious history.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
