      "value": "I can’t say anything about the moderation or moderation team, but I was there with this dev much of the night and he dealt with a lot of others earlier and obviously was tired of dealing with it while he was trying to enjoy his evening. I don’t blame him for his response at all. Having a short clip like that out of context is not very helpful.",
