      "value": "@{5ba582b58c7e6b41cd563bf6|full_name}: Sounds like they need to hire some dedicated moderators then, so people don't need to ask random devs to remove script kiddies. Hire some moderators, bring back the 'request moderator' button to players who aren't visitor status, and have the ability take the button away from anyone who misuses it.",
