      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I jump worlds a fair bit, on one hand people openly talking about ripping models or using clients in void clubs (around 70% of the time). Kinda hard to not notice/ walk into it.\nThen on the other hand , i see people on half-naked children looking models, this happens in public worlds. This keeps me away from the game more than anything else.\nno matter how many reports get sent, i just see the same people doing it, nothing happens they just continue going around on those models exposing themselves to adults and children alike. \n-also real reports sent via website not the in game button click- \nI guess it just bothers me that there's real issues that need attention, that never get touched.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
