      "value": "@{5bafbca9282d5d55fb6899f8|full_name}: Might want to limit that player status to at least \"trusted.\" There are tons of people not within the \"visitor\" status that would have that ability. Thousands of people misuse 911 today in the real world. With how chaotic the player base is in VRChat, I believe the moderators would have a mass intake of requests. \nThen they would have to black-list all of those people who misuse it. That alone would take probably, what, months?\nBack then, it was perfectly fine because there were only about a couple hundred people on VRChat at the same time. The community was so tiny it was manageable.\nOn the other hand, I have heard many rumors from a few of my friends and other people about the moderators not doing their job for legit reasons, such as 753, whoever that is down there V-V-V...  \nI've never known about any mods that do this, nor have I heard of this until as of recently, but If that is the case, it needs to be dealt with.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
