      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm a regular player who's quiet, never has drama & gets along with many users yet I'm randomly banned twice for very small reasons (currently 1 monthed now infact). Messaging support with straight to the point appeals got me nowhere. I do not use NSFW/client/harm any users, I simply want to spend time around my wonderful friends & upload avatars which I keep as optimised as possible since I don't like causing hassle. Feel like I am asking for too much though",
