      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "This post is not appropriate for the VRChat Feedback boards. The VRChat Team does not consist solely of moderators. As noted in our Community Guidelines: **\"When encountering a VRChat employee in the app, please keep in mind that even employees come in to relax and hang out with the community. Please respect their free time and treat them as you would other community members.\"**\nVRChat Moderators will never be visible in the application, and will only communicate with VRChat players via the Moderation ticket system. They will _never_ contact users in the application or via any other method.\nAll communications regarding the Moderation team or Moderation in VRChat must be submitted via our Moderation help form.\n[Contact our Moderation team](http://help.vrchat.com/new) (and select the \"MOD\" category) to request information regarding moderation, or to submit a moderation report.",
