      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: Does that actually work or is that just to waste peoples time until they give up? It says you'll get back to us within 24 business hours but it took 2 months for me to get an automated \"ban appeal denied\" email. I've seen quite a few people banned for ridiculous reasons like ban evasion on their main account but I've never seen anyone get anything but the automated response. Even if your email isn't a ban appeal, if the title has ban in it you're going to get a \"we read your email and due to overwhelming proof your appeal is denied.\" If they actually read the email they'd know it wasn't a ban appeal.\nWhat actually does work, instead of contacting their moderation team, is personally messaging VRChat staff over Discord. I've seen that work more often than I've seen someone get anything resolved through email.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-07-21T19:57:07.919Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The VRChat moderation team (this includes members of the VRChat team) never has been the greatest but it feels as though it has been degrading over time.\nSomeone could be violating terms of service in the same lobby as them and 90% of them wont care and or wont do anything about it.\nI've met several people have been banned for no reason and/or were banned from something like ban evasion when they've only ever had one account their entire time on VRChat.\nI'm sure some of you people reading this right now have fallen victim to things like this.\nIf you'd like to see an example of how great the team is currently, here is a small clip for your viewing pleasure.\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tKg1GhK5ev0\nRegardless of your position in the team, you should care about what goes on in the game especially if its happening in the same lobby as you.\nI'm not directly asking for a new moderation team but maybe just maybe things could be stepped up a bit.\nYour friend,\nOdds",
